error: `a.b` is not a legal wire key: it has to be exactly one path segment.
       A key is the name an argument arrives under and the name a generated client gives the parameter, so it may not be empty and may not contain `.`, `[` or `]` — neither Dart nor TypeScript has an identifier containing one.
       Fix: choose a key made only of characters a path segment allows, with `#[duet(rename = "...")]`.
